fin-market-rules:ScopeExpression a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "ScopeExpression, is a provenanced boolean expression over scope terms that declares the applicability scope of a rule, used for composing scope dimensions with conjunction, disjunction, and exception instead of a flat single-dimension scope. A scope expression lets a rule apply to, for example, a trading session and an instrument class except a named set of instruments.";
    rdfs:label "Scope Expression";
    rdfs:subClassOf _:r_0f046f9063b0dcf559e65ca6, _:r_370f693eaa39ff3dcc690b17, _:r_3e15152fe1ec5f86b0fbc6e7, _:r_d71ad93f8c656d5eb74d551f, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactVersion>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/ProvenancedFact>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/TemporalFact>.
<https://axiolune.ai/ontology/finance/market-rules/ScopeExpression/LogicalIdentity> a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "Stable FactIdentity companion for immutable Scope Expression versions.";
    rdfs:label "Scope Expression logical identity";
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactIdentity>;
    owl:disjointWith <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactVersion>.
fin-market-rules:ScopeExpressionForm a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "Scope Expression Form, is a closed classification of the boolean form of a scope expression, used for declaring how constituent scope terms are combined.";
    rdfs:label "Scope Expression Form";
    owl:oneOf _:l_5964ffc124c53ba7abb99552_0.
